    "description": "Lowering CBSL\u2019s inflation target from 5% to 2% is desirable for economic stability",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Lowering-CBSL-s-inflation-target-from-5-to-2-is-desirable-for-economic-stability/4-794005",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
