    "chunk_size_bytes": 1655,
    "chunk_text": "eMarketingEye to host EME Level Up: AI Hospitality Connect Sri Lanka 2026\n\nExclusive invitation-only conference to bring together hospitality leaders to explore future of AI and digital marketing in hospitality\n\neMarketingEye, Asia\u2019s leading digital marketing agency specialising in the hospitality sector, has announced EME Level Up: AI Hospitality Connect, Sri Lanka 2026, a premier invitation-only conference for the hospitality industry. The event is scheduled to take place on 14 July 2026, at Shangri-La Colombo.\n\nUnder the theme \u201cThink. Innovate. Elevate.\u201d, the conference will spotlight the rapidly growing role of artificial intelligence, digital marketing, data-driven strategies, and emerging technologies in transforming how hospitality brands connect with guests, strengthen their digital visibility, and accelerate business growth.\n\nEME Level Up: AI Hospitality Connect, Sri Lanka 2026 is set to be a premier gathering for hospitality leaders, expected to bring together over 180 delegates from Sri Lanka and the Maldives for an afternoon full of insights, innovation, and meaningful networking. Featuring 7+ curated sessions and distinguished speakers, the conference will explore the latest trends, strategies, and technologies shaping the future of hospitality, digital marketing, AI visibility, and direct bookings.\n\nDesigned for hoteliers, marketing directors, hotel owners and industry decision-makers, EME Level Up: AI Hospitality Connect, Sri Lanka 2026 will offer practical insights, thought leadership, and real-world perspectives to help hospitality brands remain competitive in today\u2019s rapidly evolving digital landscape."
