    "description": "Hotter inflation unlikely to trigger fresh rate hikes: Bloomberg Economics",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Hotter-inflation-unlikely-to-trigger-fresh-rate-hikes-Bloomberg-Economics/108-344448",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
