    "description": "Who will become Sri Lanka\u2019s most popular websites? BestWeb.LK 2026 opens Rate & Review",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/who-will-become-sri-lankas-most-popular-websites-bestweb-lk-2026-opens-rate-review/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
