    "chunk_text": "Dialog Air Fibre powers new era of ultra-fast Home WiFi\n\nDialog Axiata Head of Business, Fixed Broadband and Global Tharindra Gooneratne (third from left) presents the ultra-fast home WiFi solution to a customer. Others from left: Assistant Product Manager (5G) Fixed Business Lahiru Anjana, Product Development Manager, Fixed Business Pasindu Bandaranayake, Head of Brands, Home Sherani Silva\u00a0 and Assistant Brand Manager Upekshi Perera\n\nDialog Axiata PLC, yesterday announced the commercial launch of Dialog Air Fibre, the country\u2019s first 5G-powered, ultra-fast wireless broadband service, following exceptional demand during its pre-order phase.\n\nPowered by Dialog\u2019s rapidly expanding 5G network, now spanning over 1,000 sites nationwide, Air Fibre delivers high-speed internet without the need for physical cables. Built for modern digital lifestyles, the service seamlessly supports streaming, gaming, video conferencing, and remote work across multiple devices, and includes a built-in battery offering up to six hours of connectivity during power outages.\n\nAir Fibre is available in three plans: 100GB at Rs. 2,795, 200GB at Rs. 3,795, and 300GB at Rs. 5,495 (tax inclusive). Dialog Air Fibre Customers also enjoy complimentary access to over 100 TV channels via Dialog Play, along with a range of digital entertainment benefits, bringing connectivity and content together in a single, compelling offering.\n\nHead of Business, Fixed Broadband and Global Tharindra Gooneratne said:\u00a0 \u201cDialog Air Fibre redefines how Sri Lankan households access high-speed broadband. By leveraging the power of our 5G network, we are delivering a flexible, home broadband solution that meets the evolving connectivity needs of our customers.\u201d"
