    "description": "Heavy Mineral Mining: Sri Lanka\u2019s Untapped  Economic Engine Must Be Developed Responsibly, Not Ignored",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Heavy-Mineral-Mining-Sri-Lankas-Untapped-Economic-Engine-Must-Be-Developed-Responsibly-Not-Ignored/172-344662",
