    "description": "Central bank gold holdings are at a 50year high. What\u2019s behind the jump in\u00a0reserves?",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/central-bank-gold-holdings-are-at-a-50year-high-whats-behind-the-jump-in-reserves/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
