    "chunk_size_bytes": 901,
    "chunk_text": "This approach continued thanks to policy blunders of the GR presidency. An obvious result of this financial skulduggery was rapidly rising inflation which led to social distress, business disadvantages, rupee devaluation and added commitments by way of ISB (International Sovereign Bond) borrowings. PBJ\u2019s experiments had gone horribly wrong and laid the foundation for disaster when the unanticipated Covid epidemic hit the country. Covid emasculated all the sources of our national income such as tourism, foreign remittances, external trade and domestic production. Further foolish policy decisions-particularly about agriculture were in the pipe line, and the country was heading for an unprecedented disaster and GR was led to an ignominious exit which laid him and his party prostrate, perhaps never to rise again.\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
