    "description": "AIA\u2019s first \u2018Dansala on a Train\u2019 takes the spirit of local hospitality onboard",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/aias-first-dansala-on-a-train-takes-the-spirit-of-local-hospitality-onboard/",
    "lang": "en",
