    "md5": "0bdad478f1f0dacbee78d9d95b97b27d",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1788,
    "chunk_text": "Assetline Insurance Brokers-Toyota Lanka enhance customer protection and convenience\n\nDavid Pieris Group of Companies Group Chairman and Managing Director Rohana Dissanayake and Toyota Lanka Chairman Masaaki Kawabata exchange agreements in the presence of AIBL Chairman Dhanika De Silva, Managing Director/CEO/Principal Officer Nihal Handunge, Director Sales Mahesh De Alwis, Chief Operating Officer Anuradha Hettige, Assistant Manager Operations Manoj Augustus, Associate Operations Roobini Vimasha, Toyota Lanka Managing Director and CEO Manohara Atukorala, Chief Operating Officer Mathisha Samaranayake, General Manager Sales Ravi Opatha, Project Manager VCMS Naotaka Takeda, Unit Head VCMS Srivindya Jayawardena, Senior Head Asanga Paranahewa and Assistant Manager Legal Hasanthi Dias\n\nAssetline Insurance Brokers (Pvt.) Ltd (AIBL), the insurance arm of the David Pieris group and one of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading insurance brokering companies, has entered into a strategic partnership with Toyota Lanka (Private) Limited through the signing of a memorandum of understanding, aimed at delivering enhanced value, convenience and comprehensive insurance solutions to the customers across the country.\n\nThe collaboration brings together two trusted industry leaders with a shared commitment to customer excellence and service innovation. Through this partnership, the customers purchasing vehicles from Toyota Lanka and utilising its renowned after-sales services will gain access to a wide range of insurance solutions facilitated by AIBL.\n\nWith nearly two decades of industry experience, AIBL has established itself as the second-largest insurance broker in Sri Lanka, providing expert insurance advisory services and tailored risk management solutions to individuals and businesses alike."
