    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/39th-Anniversary-of-Indo-Lanka-accord-Rajiv-and-JRJs-Miraculous-Escape-During-the-Indo-Lanka-Accord/172-344765",
    "lang": "en",
