    "chunk_size_bytes": 1201,
    "chunk_text": "Vidusha Nathavitharana inspires IDL leadership with session on \u2018Collective Leadership\u2019\n\nIDL Deputy Chairperson Indhu Selvaratnam presents a token of appreciation to Vidusha Nathavitharana. CEO Janek Jayasekara (left), CHRO Rohitha Amarapala and Manager \u2013 Modern Trade Rukshan Jayasinghe (right) are also present\n\nVidusha Nathavitharana, an internationally acclaimed leadership trainer, HR consultant and bestselling author, once again demonstrated his ability to engage and inspire senior corporate audiences, this time delivering a compelling session on \u201cCollective Leadership\u201d to the leadership team of International Distillers Ltd. (IDL), one of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading beverage manufacturers. The lecture, held at IDL\u2019s Kaduwela Plant on 22 June 2026, formed part of the company\u2019s prestigious Guest Lecture Series, underscoring the calibre of thought leadership Nathavitharana continues to bring to organisations across the region.\n\nThe session was attended by IDL Deputy Chairperson Indhu Selvaratnam, members of the senior leadership team and the wider management team, a testament to the strong demand among Sri Lanka\u2019s corporate leadership for the insights Nathavitharana offers."
  },
