    "chunk_text": "Fresh unrest erupts at Negombo Prison\n\nColombo, July 6 (Daily Mirror) - A fresh tense situation erupted at the Negombo Prison today, with several prison officers reportedly injured as authorities moved to bring the unrest under control.\n\nThe latest unrest follows a violent clash between two groups of inmates at the prison yesterday.\n\nThe confrontation, which broke out between remand and convicted prisoners, left two inmates dead and 38 others injured. Authorities are yet to disclose the cause of today's renewed violence."
