    "chunk_text": "Justice Minister takes responsibility over Negombo prison clash\n\nColombo, July 6 (Daily Mirror) - Minister of Justice and National Integration Harshana Nanayakkara said he will take the responsibility as the minister in charge of prions over the clash at the Negombo prison.\n\nSpeaking to the media he said the situation at the Negombo prison has now been brought under control.\n\nThe Minister said the government will take measures to ensure that a similar situation will not recur in the future.\n\nHe said a comprehensive investigation will be conducted into what led to the clash.\n\nTwo dead, 35 injured in Negombo Prison clash over alleged drug trade dispute"
