    "chunk_text": "Last Saturday (4th), JAYASRI did their thing with WAYO at the YAMAYA CONCERT, held at the prestigious Indigo, at The O2, in London.\n\nThey will also join WAYO\u2019s European run on 11th July in Brescia, and 18th July in Naples, Italy.\n\nRohitha and Rohan with the Legendary Icons of Sri Lankan Reggaeand World Music Award\n\nThey played Edmonton\u2019s Glamour Night on 20th June and Toronto\u2019s Lankan Fest Open Air on 27th June.\n\n\u201cFrom the top hemisphere to the bottom, it\u2019s a season of travel, music, and connecting with audiences everywhere. Feeling blessed,\u201d says the band.\n\nThere\u2019s more for the fans, too. A brand-new JAYASRI T-shirt collection is finished and will be available soon through JAYASRI Merchandising. All proceeds, they say, will support underprivileged children and their education in Sri Lanka.\n\nAfter the summer, the plan is to return to Sri Lanka around the end of September 2026.\n\n\u201cAnd a final note of respect: Thanks and much respect to Ivan Alvis of The Island newspaper, for all you are doing towards the music scene for decades. We love you.\u201d\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
