    "chunk_size_bytes": 1576,
    "chunk_text": "Stanley Lifestyles enters Sri Lanka through strategic partnership with Singer\n\nThe newly opened Stanley Boutique Homes showroom in Ward Place\n\nStanley Lifestyles, India\u2019s leading luxury furniture and lifestyle brand, has officially entered the Sri Lankan market through a strategic partnership with Singer Sri Lanka PLC, the country\u2019s leading retailer, introducing a distinguished collection of world-class furniture defined by exceptional craftsmanship, refined design, and uncompromising quality.\n\nThe collaboration marks a significant milestone in Stanley Lifestyles\u2019 international expansion journey while bringing globally benchmarked luxury living solutions to Sri Lankan consumers.\n\nAs part of its debut in Sri Lanka, Stanley Lifestyles officially opened its flagship showroom, Stanley Boutique Homes, at No. 24, Ward Place, Colombo 07. Designed to offer an immersive luxury retail experience, the showroom showcases the brand\u2019s curated portfolio of premium furniture collections, allowing customers to experience first-hand the craftsmanship, design excellence, and superior quality that define the Stanley Lifestyles brand.\n\nOver the years, Stanley Lifestyles has established itself as one of India\u2019s most respected names in luxury furniture, earning recognition for its meticulous attention to detail, premium materials, and timeless design philosophy. Trusted by homeowners, architects, and interior designers alike, the brand has built a reputation for creating sophisticated living environments that seamlessly blend comfort, functionality, and elegance."
  },
  {
