    "md5": "4193cc8226f9cdc922af0150d82f76a1",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1845,
    "chunk_text": "IT Gallery Computers excels at \u2018Lenovo 360 Accelerate 2026\u2019 regional summit\n\nIT Gallery Computers (Pvt) Ltd.has been honoured with the \u2018Distributor Excellence Award 2025\u20132026 | Gaming & Visual Sri Lanka\u2019 at the Lenovo 360 Accelerate 2026, marking a significant milestone in its continued partnership with Lenovo and its contribution to the growth of the Gaming & Visual business segment in Sri Lanka.\n\nThe recognition underscores IT Gallery Computers (Pvt) Ltd. as a key driving force in expanding Lenovo\u2019s presence in the local market, particularly within high-growth categories such as gaming, creator-focused devices, and visual computing solutions.\n\nThe award celebrates the company\u2019s sustained efforts in strengthening channel partnerships, developing the market, and building long-term customer trust across Sri Lanka\u2019s ICT ecosystem.\n\nOver the years, IT Gallery Computers (Pvt) Ltd. has played a pivotal role in enabling wider access to premium Lenovo technologies through a strong nationwide reseller network. Its consistent investment in partner development, brand engagement activities, and customer-centric initiatives has helped accelerate category awareness and adoption across gaming enthusiasts, creative professionals, educational institutions, and corporate users.\n\nIT Gallery Computers (Pvt) Ltd.\u00a0 also continues to strengthen Lenovo\u2019s Gaming & Visual portfolio in Sri Lanka through product lines such as Lenovo Legion and LOQ gaming devices, Lenovo Legion gaming monitors, and Lenovo ThinkVision monitors for creators and professionals.\n\nFor consumers, the company offers an extensive range of Lenovo monitors and display solutions, with sizes ranging from 16-inch to 49-inch models, including Full HD 1080P, 4K, OLED, and curved display options tailored to suit a variety of user needs and market segments."
  },
