    "description": "Upper-middle income label is a myth in reality",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Upper-middle-income-label-is-a-myth-in-reality/172-344895",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
