    "chunk_text": "Parliament to take up debate on prison clash today\n\nColombo, July 7 (Daily Mirror) - Parliament is to take up a debate on the Negombo prison clashes today from 3.30 pm to 6.30 pm, Speaker Jagath Wickramaratne announced today.\n\nThe debate was given in response to a motion submitted by the Opposition calling for an urgent debate.\n\nNo casualties among foreign inmates in Negombo prison clash: Authorities"
