    "chunk_text": "Government gazettes new Mahamodara Prison\n\nColombo, July 8 (Daily Mirror) - The Minister of Justice and National Integration, Harshana Nanayakkara, has issued an Extraordinary Gazette notification ordering the establishment of a new prison in the Mahamodara area of Galle.\n\nThe relevant gazette notification was issued under the signature of Minister Nanayakkara, exercising the powers vested in him under Section 2 of the Prisons Ordinance.\n\nIt was reported that the new prison is scheduled to be operated on a temporary basis within a section of the closed Mahamodara Hospital."
