    "chunk_text": "Dengue death toll rises to 42\n\nColombo, July 8 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0The number of dengue-related deaths reported in Sri Lanka so far this year has climbed to 42, the National Dengue Control Unit (NDCU) said.\n\nAccording to acting Director of the NDCU, Dr. Kapila Kannangara, a total of 63,835 dengue cases have been reported across the country to date.\n\nHe said 8,450 cases were recorded in July alone and added that special dengue control operations would continue over the next few days to curb the spread of the disease.\n\nDengue vaccine has 90% effectiveness against type 2 virus \u2013 Expert"
