    "chunk_size_bytes": 640,
    "chunk_text": "Four buses seized for running on kerosene fuel\n\nColombo, July 8 (Daily Mirror) - Four passenger transport buses have been taken into custody by the Ambalangoda Police for allegedly operating using kerosene as fuel instead of diesel.\n\nThe buses were seized during an operation carried out yesterday (7) evening by officers attached to the Traffic Division of the Ambalangoda Police.\n\nPolice said the seized buses were operating on the Galle\u2013Colombo and Ambalangoda\u2013Elpitiya routes.\n\nInvestigations revealed that some of the buses had been operating entirely on kerosene, while others had been running on a mixture of kerosene and diesel."
