    "chunk_text": "\u2019\u2019Water Supply Disconnection Week\u2019\u2019 programme cancelled: NWSDB\n\nColombo, July 8 (Daily Mirror) - The National Water Supply and Drainage Board (NWSDB) has announced that the \"Water Supply Disconnection Week\" programme, which was scheduled to be carried out from July 13 to 19, 2026, has been cancelled.\n\nThe programme was earlier announced for Colombo 1 to 15, Maharagama and Kotte areas.\n\nThe Board said all previous announcements regarding the programme are no longer valid.\n\nThe NWSDB also expressed regret for any inconvenience caused to affected water consumers due to the cancellation."
  },
