    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s grossly confusing foreign reserve numbers \u2013 Explained",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Sri-Lanka-s-grossly-confusing-foreign-reserve-numbers-Explained/14-794407",
